id: og_funicular_c
name: Funicular III
description: Funicular. A bottom station, a top station, and a slope between them with one track on it, so the whole map is a diagonal and there is one way along it. Built as a hillside funicular railway; the haulage rope parted and the upper car is still where it stopped.

